sequenceDiagram
autonumber
actor User
participant UI as Web UI
participant App as Application boundary
participant Auth as Owner gate
participant Store as Owned data store
participant AI as Recipe provider
User->>UI: Generate recipes
UI->>App: POST /recipes/generate with JWT
App->>Auth: Verify signature, expiry and subject
Auth-->>App: Verified account id or deny
Note over App,Auth: Denied requests stop with 401 before provider/data access
App->>Store: Snapshot current account inventory and preferences
Store-->>App: Ingredient names, dietary and allergen lists
alt Inventory empty
 App-->>UI: 400 add ingredients first, no AI call
else Inventory nonempty
 App->>AI: generate(ingredients, dietary, allergens)
 alt Timeout or unavailable
  App-->>UI: Retryable 503, no state changes
 else Provider returns candidates
  AI-->>App: Candidate batch
  App->>App: Validate every candidate and declared allergen names
  alt Malformed batch
   App-->>UI: Sanitized 502, store nothing
  else Declared allergen conflict
   App-->>UI: 422, reject entire batch
  else Complete valid batch
   App->>Store: BEGIN, assign ids and insert recipes with children, COMMIT
   Store-->>App: Complete owned batch committed
   App-->>UI: 200 recipes with internal ids
  end
 end
end
Note over App,Store: No inventory deduction or history views, failed writes roll back
UI-->>User: Results or a clear error, prior personal data retained
